{"4560290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sweet Dance", "steam_appid": 4560290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Sweet Dance” is a next-generation 3D dress-up rhythm dance game that seamlessly blends music, dance, social interaction, character development, diverse outfit customization, and multiple gameplay modes. Featuring cutting-edge high-fidelity character models, it offers a vast collection of fashionable outfits to mix and match at will. The game brings popular trending dance moves and viral TikTok hits to life, waiting for you to unlock and enjoy. With a brand-new social discovery system, you can connect with new friends anytime and ignite romantic encounters. Additionally, <strong>&quot;Sweet Dance&quot;</strong> offers over a thousand stylish outfits, along with stunning mounts and richly detailed scenes, ensuring players enjoy a wide variety of choices and endless entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560290/extras/ccffe9adebb7af4e560eed958388582f.poster.avif?t=1784082589\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560290/extras/ccffe9adebb7af4e560eed958388582f.webm?t=1784082589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560290/extras/ccffe9adebb7af4e560eed958388582f.mp4?t=1784082589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you to every player who has joined us on this journey! To celebrate the official launch, we have prepared generous in-game rewards for all new idols. Log in daily to claim tons of resources — don't miss out on your daily surprises!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>On top of that, we have a special 【Exclusive Starte